### Home Route
GET http://localhost:5000/

###

### Register User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leo",
  "email": "leo@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### Login User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "leo@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}